# HTTP headers for static hosting (Cloudflare Pages format).
# See docs/HOSTING.md.
#
# Search indexing: the production site (https://troop32.org) may be indexed, so
# the rule for every path has no X-Robots-Tag. The Cloudflare Pages addresses
# (troop32.pages.dev and its per-deploy preview hosts) serve the same files and
# must stay out of search results, so they get X-Robots-Tag below.
# Keep this consistent with `indexable` in src/data/site.ts and public/robots.txt
# (tests/pages/launch.test.ts checks all three).
#
# HSTS: one year, deliberately WITHOUT includeSubDomains and WITHOUT preload, so
# other troop32.org hostnames (such as mail) are never affected.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

https://troop32.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

https://:version.troop32.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
